%% Title: Context Ingestion Flow
%% Description: How URLs and files become RAG context for debate agents

flowchart TD
    A[User Adds Context] --> B{URL or File?}
    B -- URL --> C[POST /rag/ingest-url]
    C --> D[SimpleWebPageReader<br/>Fetches + Cleans HTML]
    B -- File --> E[POST /rag/ingest-file]
    E --> F{File Type?}
    F -- PDF --> G[PDFReader]
    F -- DOCX --> H[DocxReader]
    F -- TXT/MD --> I[UTF-8 Decode]
    G --> J[Extracted Text]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    D --> J
    J --> K[SentenceSplitter<br/>500 tokens, 50 overlap]
    K --> L[all-MiniLM-L6-v2<br/>Embed Chunks]
    L --> M[Upsert to ChromaDB<br/>forge_context collection]
    M --> N[Update sources.json<br/>with Metadata]
    N --> O[Source Chip Shown<br/>in ContextDrop UI]
